<title>UK: NWE low sulphur straight-run fuel oil steady.</title>
<headline>NWE low sulphur straight-run fuel oil steady.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE low sulphur straight-run fuel oil was steady on Wednesday despite firmer futures, as prompt material weighed on the market, traders said.</p>
<p>Some material out of Germany was expected to be discounted as it was very prompt. Other cargoes were assessed at around $120 fob NWE.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
